  {
    You~tried~to~declare~a~hook~with~#2~arguments,~but~a~
    hook~can~only~have~up~to~nine.~LaTeX~will~define~this~
    hook~with~nine~arguments.
  }
\msg_new:nnnn { hooks } { without-args }
